## 10. Database Interaction Rules

- **Use `pgx`**: We use `github.com/jackc/pgx/v5`
- **Transaction Mode**: DB is accessed via PgBouncer in transaction mode
  - Do NOT use prepared statements unless necessary
  - Keep transactions short
- **Session Context**: Always set RLS context before queries
  ```go
  tx.Exec(ctx, "SELECT set_session_context($1, $2)", accountID, userID)
  ```
- **Schema**: Modifying schema requires updating `resources/db/schema.sql` and `docs/SCHEMA_DOC.md`

---

## 11. Naming Conventions

| Component       | Pattern                           | Example                      |
|-----------------|-----------------------------------|------------------------------|
| Service         | `internal/modules/foo/foosvc`     | `foosvc.FooSvc`              |
| Handler         | `internal/modules/foo/foohdlr`    | `foohdlr.FooHdlr`            |
| Models Package  | `internal/modules/foo/foomdl`     | `foomdl.Foo`                 |
| Entity Model    | `{Entity}`                        | `Foo`, `User`, `Account`     |
| Entity File     | `{module}.go`                     | `foo.go`, `user.go`          |
| Request Model   | `{Action}{Entity}Req`             | `CreateFooReq`, `ListFoosReq`|
| Request File    | `{module}_req.go`                 | `foo_req.go`                 |
| Response Model  | `{Entity}Rsp`, `List{Entity}sRsp` | `FooRsp`, `ListFoosRsp`      |
| Response File   | `{module}_rsp.go`                 | `foo_rsp.go`                 |
| Transformer     | `To{Target}`                      | `ToFooRsp`, `ToFooRspList`   |
| DTO File        | `{module}_dto.go`                 | `foo_dto.go`                 |
| Constructor     | `NewFooSvc`, `NewFooHdlr`         |                              |
| Methods         | verb-noun style                   | `CreateFoo`, `GetByID`       |
| Cache           | `{module}Cache`                   | `fooCache`                   |

